{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;A success story born from loneliness, debt, and filth.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your wife left you. You lost your home. Your life fell apart.<br>Just when you thought it was all over\u2026 a flyer hits your head:<br><strong>&quot;Cheap Rental: Old Bus Terminal Toilet&quot;</strong><br>And so begins the Toilet Simulator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your New Life: Toilet Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take over a rundown, abandoned public restroom and turn it into the most iconic hygiene hotspot in town.<br>Wash it, decorate it, choose the toilets, even place the soap dispensers.<br>But be warned: this is only the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udebd What Awaits You in the Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight off perverts, thieves, and the mafia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect trash, fix broken items, and buy cleaning supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep customers happy\u2014or they'll never return</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set your own usage fee for the toilet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat, shop, even relax with a drink \u2013 everything is available at the terminal!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae About the Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo, you can only complete the <strong>tutorial missions</strong>.<br>In Early Access, you\u2019ll unlock all other missions and more content.<br>By finishing the demo missions, you\u2019ll learn the core mechanics and be ready for the full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763460?t=1751989697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763460?t=1751989697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763460/17696787064883fa3c9e5fe4180f9fb56274f069/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751989697","c